WEBVTT

00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:00.935
(woman screaming)

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:03.980
(moaning)

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:07.901
Towels.
毛巾

00:01:07.984 --> 00:01:10.695
- (screaming)
- Oh...

00:01:15.867 --> 00:01:19.162
(baby crying)

00:01:37.472 --> 00:01:41.226
Lord Miraz? You have a son.
恭贺您喜获麟儿

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:47.232
(sighs) The heavens
have blessed us.
感谢上苍眷顾

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:52.237
You know your orders.
你很清楚指令

00:01:56.908 --> 00:01:58.743
General Glozelle?
葛洛塞将军？

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:02.914
Yes, my lord.
是的 陛下

00:02:05.834 --> 00:02:08.211
(door opens)

00:02:25.562 --> 00:02:27.272
(door opens)

00:02:32.402 --> 00:02:34.279
(gasping)

00:02:37.615 --> 00:02:38.575
Five more minutes.
再睡五分钟

00:02:38.658 --> 00:02:41.661
You won't be watching
the stars tonight, my prince.
你今晚见不着星星了 王子

00:02:41.744 --> 00:02:43.746
Come. We must hurry.
来 我们要快

00:02:46.875 --> 00:02:50.128
- Professor, what's going on?
- Your aunt has given birth...
博士 怎么回事？
你的婶婶生了…

00:02:51.296 --> 00:02:52.630
...to a son.
一位王子

00:02:58.011 --> 00:02:59.304
Come.
来吧

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:26.581
(bird screeching)

00:03:37.675 --> 00:03:40.637
(panting)

00:03:50.021 --> 00:03:52.190
You must make for the woods.
你得设法逃去树林

00:03:52.273 --> 00:03:54.651
- The woods?
- They won't follow you there.
树林？
他们不敢跟你进去的

00:03:57.737 --> 00:04:00.406
It has taken me
many years to find this.
我花了好多年才找到这个

00:04:02.533 --> 00:04:05.620
Do not use it except
at your greatest need.
除非有迫切需要才能用它

00:04:05.703 --> 00:04:07.872
Will I ever see you again?
我会再见到你吗？

00:04:07.956 --> 00:04:10.959
I dearly hope so, my prince.
我希望可以 王子

00:04:11.042 --> 00:04:14.837
There is so much more
I meant to tell you.
我有好多事想告诉你

00:04:14.921 --> 00:04:18.591
Everything you know is about to change.
你所知的一切都即将改变

00:04:18.675 --> 00:04:21.302
(man) Close the drawbridge!
关上吊桥

00:04:21.386 --> 00:04:22.845
Now, go.
快走

00:04:28.643 --> 00:04:30.853
- Halt!
- Halt!
停！
停！

00:04:45.868 --> 00:04:48.955
- (horse whinnies)
- (man) A son! A son!
王子！是王子！

00:04:49.038 --> 00:04:53.584
Lady Prunaprismia has this night
given Lord Miraz a son!
王后今晚为陛下生下皇子
捉住他

00:05:02.427 --> 00:05:04.178
Yah!

00:05:39.672 --> 00:05:41.341
(men) Whoa!

00:05:41.424 --> 00:05:43.885
(horses whinnies)

00:05:46.596 --> 00:05:50.558
Which of you superstitious old women
wants to spend the night in a cell?
那个迷信的今晚想回去蹲苦牢

